<view class="page"><view class="poster-card"><text class="brand">轻减日记</text><text class="flower">✦</text><text class="headline">{{reached ? '我做到了！' : '我正在靠近目标'}}</text><text class="name">{{profile.nickname}}</text><view class="numbers"><view><text>起始</text><b>{{profile.startWeight}}<small> kg</small></b></view><view><text>当前</text><b>{{current.weight || profile.startWeight}}<small> kg</small></b></view><view><text>目标</text><b>{{profile.targetWeight}}<small> kg</small></b></view></view><text class="caption">{{reached ? '每一份坚持，都值得被看见。' : '慢慢来，记录本身也是一种进步。'}}</text></view><text class="muted hint">海报采用动态数据生成；保存前会在真机中完成清晰度与安全区校验。</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="save">保存海报</button></view>
